// A blast sets off a second charge up to 1.5 m beyond its 2.25 m radius. Here the second charge is
// 3 m right and 1 m up (3.16 m away): at 8 cells/m a bare-cell margin only reached 3.0 m and it stayed put.
map
##########################################
#........................................#
#........................................#
#........................................#
#........................................#
#........................................#
#........................................#
#........................................#
#........................................#
#...................@....................#
##########################################
end
give Tnt 2
device 3 -6 -1 Tnt
device 4 6 -5 Tnt
expect 10 dev:6,-5,Tnt == 1
use 20 -6 -1
expect 100 ev:Explode == 0      // the lit fuse runs 1.5 s
expect 130 ev:Explode == 2      // first charge, and the second set off by its blast
expect 130 dev:6,-5,Tnt == 0
